        <mxCell id="RRk26FoSYtyyhybvWdbO-6" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;Chunk Retrieved&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;L4 x I3 = 12&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;(Later when user asks a related question, the system has to pull that specific poisoned chunk)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
